:[{"type":"text","value":"6–8 秒"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（國考答案）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"早產兒氣管內管抽吸：抽痰管約 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"5–8 Fr"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（正確）；鼻→口→氣管內管的順序、一次 20 秒、壓力「不可超過 60 mmHg」都是錯的"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"有氣管內管的嬰兒，抽痰順序「氣管內管→口腔→鼻腔」本身符合原則（先人工氣道再口鼻；同一條管子"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不可從口鼻再進入人工氣道"}]},{"type":"text","value":"），但 110-2_OP_063 該題官方答案是「無抽吸壓力下放入抽痰管」"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人工氣道抽痰屬"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"外科無菌"}]},{"type":"text","value":"技術"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"姿位引流"}]},{"type":"text","value":"是利用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"重力"}]},{"type":"text","value":"讓分泌物流到大支氣管"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"姿位引流較不適當的時間："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"飯後半小時"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（適合：早上睡醒、睡前、飯前 1 小時）"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"胸腔物理治療包括"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"呼吸運動與呼吸肌訓練"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；不是先叩擊再噴霧、不是飯前飯後 1 小時內、上下葉都要引流時"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不是先下葉"}]}]},{"type":"text","v